   "resumo_en": "Nunca Tem Fim... (Portuguese: Never Ends...) is the ninth and final studio album by Brazilian band O Rappa. The album was released on August 15, 2013 distributed through Warner Music. It was produced by Tom Saboia and mastered by Stephen Marcussen (Aerosmith, Nirvana, Paul McCartney) in California.\nIn 2014, the album was nominated to Latin Grammy for Best Brazilian Rock Album.",
